5.dev4\n- Not reproducible in other versions since it's the first version that comes with the zoom drag feature. see [here](https://godotengine.org/article/dev-snapshot-godot-4-5-dev-4/)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev4 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL ES 3/ANGLE (Compatibility) - ANGLE (Intel, Intel(R) HD Graphics 520 (0x00001916) Direct3D11 vs_5_0 ps_5_0, D3D11-30.0.101.1338) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-6300U CPU @ 2.40GHz (4 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen I update `Editor Settings > Editors > Panning > Zoom Style` to `Vertical` or `Horizontal`, It produces this error:  \n```  ERROR: Signal 'node_removed' is already connected to given callable 'TextureRegionEditor::_node_removed' in that object.```\n\nDemo:  \nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/987a9b12-cc28-4485-b44a-791bb19b4b80\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new project with the default settings\n2. Go to `Editor Settings > Editors > Panning` and change the `Zoom Style`\n3. Wait a second for the error to be produced\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nIt should work with every project but here is the empty project I used for the demo:\n\n[godot_issue_2025-05-14_12-16-44.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20203744/godot_issue_2025-05-14_12-16-44.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https